@startuml sd_us115b
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
title US115b - Sequence Diagram
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
actor "Maintenance Technician" as Actor
participant "Entry (Envoy)\nvirtual IP of aircraft-maintenance" as EAM
box "aircraft-maintenance-n (the replica that answers)" #F7F7F7
participant "MaintenanceController" as MaintenanceController
participant "CreateMaintenanceTemplateUseCase" as CreateMaintenanceTemplateUseCase
database "own database" as DBAM
participant "Outbox dispatcher" as OBAM
end box
collections "peer replicas\naircraft-maintenance-m" as PAM
== POST /api/maintenance/templates ==
Actor -> EAM : POST /api/maintenance/templates\n(HTTPS, Authorization: Bearer JWT)
EAM -> MaintenanceController : to a ready replica\n(another one if it fails)
MaintenanceController -> CreateMaintenanceTemplateUseCase : execute(...)
CreateMaintenanceTemplateUseCase -> DBAM : template name already in the catalog?
CreateMaintenanceTemplateUseCase -> DBAM : save maintenance template + one copy per other replica in the outbox\n(same transaction)
CreateMaintenanceTemplateUseCase --> MaintenanceController : created
MaintenanceController --> Actor : 201 Created
OBAM -> PAM : PUT /internal/replicas/maintenance-templates\n(to every other replica, retried until delivered)
PAM --> OBAM : 200 (applied if newer)
@enduml
